rop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5cc271c6315c91f821f8bf6c5a04a283 3x"}, "body": "Hello, I love your style and was hoping that I could commission you to draw my vtuber Matcha Faun.\n\nMatcha Faun is a deer boy that is also a witch. Matcha specializes in Tarot Card readings and alchemy. He uses spells to either get information he wants, to punish someone, or as surveillance. Matcha owns a tavern called the Lavender Tounge Tavern which is a cafe/bar deep in a mystical Forest. There he serves Coffee, tea, Alcohol, potions, and by far the most popular are his fortunes. \nHis magic comes from his familiar which is a mystical bat with the body of a starry night sky that when it's tired stays in the crystal on Matcha's bowtie to replenish its magic. Matcha has named this bat Lavy, Lavy can turn into  a bat style Halberd if a weapon is needed, or a tall emaciated looking beast.\n\nReferences:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1I_x-9--AamQCN8e8Fg33r9IXIktZ430y?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@uqo_kr30/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2277689, "client_id": 1911873, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/61fcd688/uploads/origins/8ad9d092-bf08-47d9-930f-464f8f68ac85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=337d1b3ed057dda1b73b3e973040adbd", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/61fcd688/uploads/origins/8ad9d092-bf08-47d9-930f-464f8f68ac85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=337d1b3ed057dda1b73b3e973040adbd, https://si.imgix.net/61fcd688/uploads/origins/8ad9d092-bf08-47d9-930f-464f8f68ac85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c91ea0f1fb70739679399eccd5835ce2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/61fcd688/uploads/origins/8ad9d092-bf08-47d9-930f-464f8f68ac85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=w